      "membership_rule": "code_node ::= code_call(attr_callee=CODE, attr_args=LIST[CODE]) | code_assign(attr_target=CODE, attr_value=CODE) | code_assert_equal(attr_expected=CODE, attr_actual=CODE) | code_identifier(attr_name=NAME_LITERAL) | code_string(attr_text=NAME_LITERAL) | code_number(attr_value=NUMBER_LITERAL) | code_type(attr_type=ENTITY). No hexadecimal encoding is permitted. Code nodes strictly use namespace-valid attribute symbols.",
