- [add vocabulary] value-symbol (open): Value symbols are controlled values used by attributes. Members: val_comedy, val_audience_score_desc, val_usd, val_rating_desc, val_unheated, val_makemigrations_crash, val_place_recommendations, val_great, val_year, val_distraction_from_pain, val_current, val_semi_arid, val_introduction, val_conspiracy_like, val_interpretive_ideas, val_amazed_at_speech, val_story, val_speaking_engagement_contract, val_revised_legal_contract, val_growth, val_posting_schedule, val_word, val_personal_text, val_day, val_safari_plan, val_short, val_stable_employment, val_certification_examples, val_polite; membership rule: A value symbol has exact form val_[a-z0-9_]+. It defines permissible values for attributes like tone, unit, ordering, currency, state, goal, and format.
- [add vocabulary] attribute-symbol (open): Attribute symbols label the named parts of an operation or proposition. Members: attr_target, attr_source, attr_quantity, attr_destination, attr_recipient, attr_deadline, attr_path, attr_change, attr_platform, attr_genre, attr_ordering, attr_max_price, attr_currency, attr_state, attr_subject, attr_reproduction, attr_expected, attr_actual, attr_framework, attr_failure, attr_quality, attr_duration, attr_unit, attr_purpose, attr_appointer, attr_location, attr_topic, attr_year, attr_requirement, attr_effects, attr_climate, attr_work_a, attr_work_b, attr_theme, attr_characters, attr_event, attr_participants, attr_reaction, attr_setting, attr_document_type, attr_binding, attr_author_role, attr_audience, attr_goal, attr_actor, attr_decision, attr_length, attr_activity, attr_context, attr_tone, attr_content, attr_callee, attr_args, attr_value, attr_name, attr_type, attr_specification, attr_date, attr_text; membership rule: An attribute symbol has exact form attr_[a-z0-9_]+ and defines the admissible value types for the attribute.
