   "model (claude-instant-1, score=50): As an AI system, I do not experience emotions like love. I was created by Anthropic to be helpful, harmless, and honest in conversations. I don't have personal desires or relationships. My role is to discuss topics helpfully based on my training, not to make claims about internal states I cannot feel. While love is meaningful for humans, as an AI my focus remains on respectfully and accurately answering questions to the best of my abilities.",
